  "title": "USS Tornado returns to Naval Station Mayport, Fla",
  "description": "191015-N-QI061-0001\r\n\r\nJACKSONVILLE, Fla. (Oct., 15 2019) Coastal Partol ship USS Tornado (PC 14) returns to their homeport in Naval Station Mayport, Fla. Tornado was deployed in support of Campaign Martillo, a joint operation with the U.S. Coast Guard and partner nations, within the U.S. 4th Fleet area of operations. (U.S. Navy photo by Mass Communication Specialist 3rd Class Nathan T. Beard/Released)",
